{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15213680","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15213680","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1521368001:0":{"text":"Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, Gala, what a surprise. I didn't think you'd come visit me again.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4E1494DCA8CC01D2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, Gala, what a surprise. I didn't think you'd come visit me again.","female":"Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, Gala, what a surprise. I didn't think you'd come visit me again.","variant_male_record_index":"183714","variant_female_record_index":"183715","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1521368001":{"text":"Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, Gala, what a surprise. I didn't think you'd come visit me again.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name></style>大人，加拉……！真没想到你们会再来看我。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4E1494DCA8CC01D2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, Gala, what a surprise. I didn't think you'd come visit me again.","female":"Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, Gala, what a surprise. I didn't think you'd come visit me again.","variant_male_record_index":"183714","variant_female_record_index":"183715","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521368003:0":{"text":"Well, life goes on.","source_cn":"人总要向前看嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC961C1BAB27E595B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521368004:0":{"text":"I've thought about that letter Marco wrote... and I don't think he meant a word of it.","source_cn":"而且我现在也想通了。马尔科写的那封信……恐怕也不是他的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80D0B06041B902C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521368005:0":{"text":"I'd rather believe what we had at Mirehold was real. And even if it wasn't... that's okay. ","source_cn":"我愿意相信我和他在水泽营地经历的一切都不是假的……就算...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38708487D453A3D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521368006:0":{"text":"It was beautiful, and it was real to me. That's enough.","source_cn":"我只要记得那很美好，就足够了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C901C8DC3A3B0BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521368007:0":{"text":"He chose to let go, and I'm choosing to respect that.","source_cn":"既然他做出了切断这段感情的决定……那我就尊重他。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEA2C10E89C7E884","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521368008:0":{"text":"Besides, if he didn't even have the courage to try, then he's not someone worth waiting for!","source_cn":"更何况，他连试都没勇气试，这样的人才不值得我挂念！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x815BB4AD1C1E4E13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1521368008":{"text":"Besides, if he didn't even have the courage to try, then he's not someone worth waiting for!","source_cn":"更何况，他连试都没勇气试，这样的人才不值得我挂念！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x815BB4AD1C1E4E13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1521368010:0":{"text":"Right now, I just want to live well.","source_cn":"现在，我只想过好以后的生活。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2C908A63EBECD08","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1521368011:0":{"text":"And I believe I will.","source_cn":"那一定会很幸福的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x917CBC847D44002A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"I'm glad you see that now.","source_cn":"很高兴你想通了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x36E4D732FF039C86","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I'm glad you see that now.","female":"I'm glad you see that now.","variant_male_record_index":"78149","variant_female_record_index":"78150","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:1:2":{"text":"Hope you find your happiness.","source_cn":"祝你以后过得幸福","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x26A8C461B48DA4F3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Hope you find your happiness.","female":"Hope you find your happiness.","variant_male_record_index":"78151","variant_female_record_index":"78152","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1521368009:0":{"text":"Maybe. But that's not my problem anymore.","source_cn":"那就不关我的事了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A9990FE358F70D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:2:3":{"text":"Marco is going to regret this.","source_cn":"我觉得马尔科会后悔的","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x002F919C1A4D87B5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Marco is going to regret this.","female":"Marco is going to regret this.","variant_male_record_index":"78153","variant_female_record_index":"78154","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:0:1":{"text":"Looks like you've moved on.","source_cn":"看来你已经走出来了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2D593EAF1012504E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Looks like you've moved on.","female":"Looks like you've moved on.","variant_male_record_index":"78145","variant_female_record_index":"78146","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1521368002:0":{"text":"Ah... yes.","source_cn":"啊……是的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29CBC9FA8F6F02B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:1:2":{"text":"Are you seeing someone new?","source_cn":"你已经开始新恋情了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA01141A75A6B5C7B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Are you seeing someone new?","female":"Are you seeing someone new?","variant_male_record_index":"78147","variant_female_record_index":"78148","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:芙":{"text":"Fufu","source":"芙","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":19,"localized_text_count":18,"speaker_count":1}}